Subject: [PATCH] Draw dynamic lights, the sky, the view model and crosshair
 like GLQuake

- Dynamic lights (muzzle flashes, rockets, explosions) light the
  vertices of the world surfaces R_PushDlights marked.
- The sky has both layers, with texture coordinates following the
  direction from the eye like GLQuake, the front layer is drawn on the
  back one with the depth test for equal.
- The view model gets the front of the depth range through the
  projection, like the depth hack of GLQuake, so it doesn't poke into
  walls.
- The crosshair is drawn in 3D on the top screen instead of into the 2D
  drawing, which is on the touch screen.
